' Question: what reaches into the alerting module, and through which port?
' Explained by: ../03-context.md, which cites each arrow. Drawn by hand, high level.
@startuml 03-context-in
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction
[shell] as SH
[bots/contracts] as BC
[operations:\nAlertingAlertChannels] as OA
actor Owner as O
[alerting] as A
SH --> A : lists AlertingModule
A ..> BC : reads BotChangedEvent,\nBotStopGaveUpEvent,\nGetBotStatusReportQuery
OA --> A : IAlertingStatus\ncarries_bot_events
O --> A : `alert test`,\nhealth snapshot
@enduml
